<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33943" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">parthĕnĭum</span></b> ,
		ii, n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρθένιον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>the name of several plants.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A plant</i>, <i>called also</i>
			perdicium, <i><span class="en">Plin. 22, 17, 20, §
			43</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A plant</i>, <i>called also</i>
			leucanthes <i>or</i> tamnacus, <i><span class="en">Plin. 21,
				30, 104, § 176</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A plant</i>, <i>called also</i>
			linozostis, hermupoa, <i>and</i> mer curialis, <i><span class="en">Plin. 25, 5,
				18, § 38</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>A plant</i>, <i>called also</i>
			chrysocollis, q. v.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
</div>